    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The typical legal risks we monitor include open-source license compliance, cross-border data flow (although we note that we operations are intra-EU only), AI Act compliance evolution, and vendor lock-in mitigation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirements outlined in The tender, we should also flag potential risks related to regulatory non-compliance, environmental liability, security breaches, and cost overruns." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while we have some relevant experience and capabilities, there are areas where we cannot confirm compliance with the requirements outlined in the tender based on we company context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, we lack information on environmental issues, security levels, and hosting infrastructure, which may pose legal risks if not properly addressed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years (con35), and the annual cost of exploitation must remain compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority (con37)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the company context, the target gross margin percentage is 28 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To calculate our projected margin on this contract, our need to first determine the total revenue over the 4-year period." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget is estimated at 3 million euros, so our assume our revenue will be equal to or less than 3 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our secure the full budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, our total revenue would be 3 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Applying our projected margin on this contract, our projected gross profit would be 840,000 euros (28% of 3 million euros)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs and ensure compatibility with the local authority budgetary capacities, our can consider strategies such as renegotiating rates with subcontractors in case of budget reductions, as mentioned in our cost sensitivity data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For a 10 percent budget reduction, our can absorb the impact via rate renegotiation with subcontractors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, for larger reductions (20-30 percent), our may need to consider scope reduction or fundamental scope changes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our should focus on efficient project management and resource allocation to minimize costs while maintaining our projected margin on this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, our can ensure a projected margin of around 28 percent while proposing cost-optimization strategies that align with the client's budgetary constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an intelligent assistance tool to accompany administrative activities (req15), search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation (con3), provide help with drafting of letters or answers to users (con4), and suggest actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process (con6)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design an AI solution that meets these requirements, and what are the potential innovation opportunities?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we can design an AI solution that leverages we expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements, we can propose a solution that integrates we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, with a RAG component to search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation. a solution that integrates our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, with a RAG component to search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation can be designed as follows: the user inputs a query or request related to an administrative activity, and a RAG component to search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation retrieves relevant information from internal procedures and applicable regulation. relevant information is then passed to our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct,." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide help with drafting letters or answers to users, we can fine-tune we LLM on a dataset of administrative documents and user queries. fine-tune will enable our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, to generate high-quality drafts that can be reviewed and edited by the user." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation opportunities, we current research topics include knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks. we can explore integrating knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks into a solution that integrates our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, with a RAG component to search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation to create a more comprehensive and dynamic intelligent assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For example, we could use knowledge graphs to represent administrative procedures and regulations, and then use knowledge graphs to inform a RAG component to search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation search and retrieval processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we expertise in explainability and trust methods, such as source citation and confidence scoring, can be applied to ensure that the AI solution provides transparent and reliable outputs. applied will help build trust with the users and facilitate adoption of the intelligent assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by combining we strengths in LLMs, RAG, and explainability, we can design a cutting-edge AI solution that meets the client's requirements and offers opportunities for innovation and growth." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires a contribution to the reduction of energetic consumption (con39) and reliance on infrastructures with low carbon impact (con40)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, the client must limit environmental footprint (con38)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainability strategies can we propose, and how can we reduce our environmental impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We can propose several sustainability strategies to contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption and reliance on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company has already implemented some digital sobriety practices such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, estimated to reduce recompute by 20%, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company also have partnerships with green hosting providers, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both based in France, who use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification. green hosting providers, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both based in France, who use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification power usage effectiveness (PUE) is 1.3 and 1.28 respectively, indicating efficient energy use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these practices and partnerships, Our company can reduce our energetic consumption and environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company estimate that Our company typical energy reduction versus baseline is around 35%, which can help the client achieve the client goals of limiting environmental footprint and reducing energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, Our company have a carbon reporting capability based on GRI Standards, although a carbon reporting capability based on GRI Standards, although it is partial, which allows us to monitor and report our carbon emissions is partial, which allows Our company to monitor and report Our company carbon emissions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable Our company to track progress towards reducing our environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company e-waste management partner, Ecologic in France, is certified for WEEE recycling, ensuring responsible disposal of electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adopting these strategies, Our company can propose a solution that not only meets but also contributes to the client's sustainability objectives, aligning with the client's requirements for reducing environmental footprint and relying on low-carbon infrastructures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "There are no agents' answers provided." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Please provide the necessary information so I can assist you in writing the proposal." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk20> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk21> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
