        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirements to implement an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents (req1), improve efficiency of administrative services (req2), and quality of service rendered to users (req3), as well as the constraints that the intelligent assistance tool must be accessible from the agents work environment (con1) and accompany the agents in the agents administrative activities (con2), how can we consolidate all agent contributions into a coherent tender response, ensuring decision traceability and detecting potential contradictions?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

