    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This process allows Nexus Engineering to identify, assess, and mitigate risks proactively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering governance tools, including the RAID log, Decision log, Change request process, and Steering committee, will ensure that all decisions are documented and traceable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging Nexus Engineering strengths in AI solutions, public sector IT, project management, and change management, Nexus Engineering can provide a comprehensive tender response that addresses the client's requirements while ensuring decision traceability and mitigating potential contradictions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response time below 2 seconds (con24), API integration with existing information systems and user directories (con27, con30, con31), hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU (con17, con32, con33), and no dependency on non-European suppliers (con34)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be assessed as follows: Response time below 2 seconds (con24): PARTIALLY COVERED. our typical performance benchmarks indicate a p95 response time of 1800 ms for RAG-based queries, which exceeds the required 2-second threshold." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our can explore optimization techniques to reduce latency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with existing information systems and user directories (con27, con30, con31): FULLY COVERED. our has experience with API standards such as REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, and our have worked with API gateways like Kong and Apigee. our also have expertise in integrating with identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP and Keycloak." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU (con17, con32, con33): FULLY COVERED. our have experience deploying solutions on OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which are European cloud providers that can meet the sovereignty requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our have deployed solutions on SecNumCloud (Outscale), which is a sovereign cloud infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers (con34): FULLY COVERED. our technology stack does not rely on non-European suppliers for critical components, and our can ensure that our proposed architecture avoids such dependencies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed Architecture: To address the client's requirements, our propose the following architecture: * Deploy the solution on a sovereign cloud infrastructure within the EU, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, to meet the hosting requirements. * Utilize our expertise in API integration to connect with existing information systems and user directories using standards like REST and GraphQL. * Implement optimization techniques to reduce latency and achieve response times below 2 seconds, such as caching, load balancing, and efficient database querying. * Leverage our experience with identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP and Keycloak to ensure secure authentication and authorization. * Ensure that all components of the solution are sourced from European suppliers to avoid dependencies on non-European vendors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following our proposed architecture, our can meet the client's requirements while leveraging Our technology stack." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (con16), data to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union (con17), no data transfer outside the European Union (con18), and protection of data in an appropriate manner using encryption and anonymization if necessary (con19)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls do we need to implement, and are we compliant with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with regulatory frameworks including RGPD/GDPR. we also have a GDPR Data Protection Officer appointed and available at dpo@nexus-engineering.it. we standard data residency is the European Union only, which aligns with the requirement to host data exclusively within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data protection, we use anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models, which can help in protecting personal data. we also have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers outside the European Union unless there is an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further ensure compliance with con19 regarding encryption and anonymization, we would need to implement specific technical measures such as encrypting data both in transit and at rest." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

